{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_myrrh_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_myrrh_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "護身符",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_myrrh_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "102edf79dd44348ac357a1a730a46f8b0ee5ad48de369b7200ceb4fc6ce142cc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "末药"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島駐烏薩斯臨時據點"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈......好睏啊，昨晚工作到凌晨四點，今天一大早就被叫起來開晨會，簡直是折磨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蘇蘇洛，為什麼你看起來一點也不睏啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還在學校的時候我們就被教導要以良好的精神面貌面對患者與工作，所以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你一大早就連喝了三大杯加濃咖啡，這可一點都不利於健康哦，蘇蘇洛幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，芙蓉，你也來了，那我們就正式開始今天的晨會吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先別著急，本艦派了新同事來哦，今天剛剛到的。快進來吧，末藥幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大、大家好，我是新轉正的末藥，叫我的本名阿德萊也可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她剛剛從實習幹員轉為正式幹員，要來我們這個據點工作。末藥幹員，這位是嘉維爾幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾小姐您好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "客氣啦，叫我嘉維爾就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，你能來我們的壓力可以減輕不少。啊，拜託人事再多招一點醫療幹員吧，我已經好久都沒有好好睡過覺了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在招啦，我問過人事那邊，說是在招啦。嘉維爾你也真是的，說得這麼誇張也不怕嚇跑新來的同事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我、我有做好心理準備，凱爾希醫生已經事先和我說過了，醫療幹員的工作會非常辛苦，要我做好準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你能提前有個認知也好，這裡的工作強度真的不是一般的大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，對了，差點忘了介紹，在嘉維爾旁邊的是蘇蘇洛幹員，你之後的工作就由她來安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，蘇蘇洛小姐，接下來就麻、麻煩您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必緊張，末藥小姐，剛開始不會給你過於困難的工作，畢竟你剛來還是需要適應期的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，好，好的，我會努力學習的，如果工作中有不足之處拜託大家指正。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太客氣啦，你來幫我們分擔工作，應該我們感謝你才是嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，嘉維爾小姐，先不說這些了，我們還是先討論今天的工作安排吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這邊收治的難民病情都在控制中，各項指標都在恢復正常，如果不出意外，有幾位下個月就可以離開了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那芙蓉這邊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這邊其他病人還好，就是有一位的情況很棘手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是哪位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是柳芭女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是她啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是她啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位女士的病情很糟糕嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柳芭女士的病情並不是很嚴重，尚在可控的範圍內。但是因為個人原因，她一直不願意配合我們的治療。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，怎麼會有病患生病了卻不願意接受治療？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為她這個人很迷信。來這裡的第一天她就告訴我，村子裡的大師曾經說她活不過七十歲，所以勸我不要在她身上白費力氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這大師聽起來一點也不可靠啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是柳芭女士對此深信不疑，有時看到一些很日常的小事還會覺得是不祥之兆......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，上周五陪她在外面散心，看到香草帶來的大黑，她面色一變轉身就走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回去之後就說自己見到了黑色源石蟲會倒楣，覺得死期將近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，怪不得我看她上周五不吃也不喝，還一直在哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）或許......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可怎麼辦啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好辦哪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，蘇蘇洛小姐，可以讓我試試嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "末藥小姐，你確定要嘗試嗎？像柳芭女士這樣的病人，不僅僅考驗我們的治療能力，對我們的溝通技巧也是不小的挑戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，要說迷信的人，我在家鄉見過不少，有一些和他們溝通的技巧，所以請讓我試一試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "末藥幹員，要不你還是再考慮一下吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，就讓小末藥試試吧，我們也沒有更好的法子了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我想想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請、請相信我，蘇蘇洛小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然末藥小姐你有一些經驗，那就先拜託你了。嘉維爾，麻煩你帶她去看看柳芭女士的病歷吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麻煩你了，嘉維爾小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的決定是不是有些......太倉促了，蘇蘇洛，我們應該再討論下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可目前的情況確實沒有更好的選擇......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣吧，末藥小姐，如果你在和柳芭女士的相處過程中出現難以解決的問題，一定要及時彙報給我們，我們都會想辦法幫助你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝大家願意信任我，我會全力以赴的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，那你先跟我來吧，小末藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙蓉，你剛剛一直欲言又止，是有什麼話不方便說嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，蘇蘇洛，怎麼辦，我有點擔心......在這之前凱爾希醫生曾和我談過一些末藥幹員的情況，關於她的一些......小特點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇蘇洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_298_sussu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是什麼樣的特點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "speakerId": "char_120_hibisc",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "末藥她，也有一點點......小迷信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅德島臨時醫療室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柳芭女士應該就在這間了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行了，快把餐盤端走，我不吃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思問下，裡面發生了什麼，柳芭女士聽起來好像很生氣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你是新來的醫生吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剛剛我不小心打翻了鹽罐，烏薩斯人好像很忌諱這樣的事，說是會帶來不幸，所以惹得她正在裡面發火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫療幹員",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "醫生你要不過一會兒再來吧，她現在正在氣頭上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我就去打個招呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ri_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說了我不吃，你回來幹什——呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，柳芭女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是蘇蘇洛醫生為您選擇的新主治醫生末藥，接下來的治療過程，還需要您的配合，我、我一定會全力以赴為您診治的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快走吧，小丫頭，走的時候把你拿來的藥原樣端回去！不要在我身上再花力氣了，老婆子我只想安安靜靜地走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "柳芭女士，那個、我並沒有帶藥來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你來做什麼呢，是來勸老婆子我不要那麼迷信，要看開些的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有的沒有的，我嘴巴特別笨，不會勸人的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，難不成你就只是為了來看看我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我給您帶了一個小玩意兒，是我從家裡面帶來的護身符，這些年一直放在身上。族長告訴我，這東西可以給佩戴的人帶來好運。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（從脖子上取下護身符遞給老婦人）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戴了很久，看著有些舊，請您不要嫌棄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它看起來挺小一個......不過還是謝謝你了，小丫頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，這東西很靈的，這些年我每次能逢凶化吉都是靠它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為......這年頭年輕人都不信這些了，他們都說要講科學、用事實說話。大概只有我這樣沒有文化又不明事理的鄉村老婆子才信這些了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我也經常被人說迷信，進實驗室的時候一定堅持左腳先邁進去，不然就會觸霉頭；在屋子裡一定要擺羽獸的飾品，因為可以旺財......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來到這裡之後，我一直因為這個覺得很難為情，周圍的同事很多都是畢業於專業的醫學院，都覺得這些事無憑無據，不足為信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們還是太年輕啊，不信命，到了我這個歲數，就知道有些東西不是人能說了算的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小時候有人給我占卜過，說我這一生都是遭罪的命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年輕時我還不相信，可看看後來發生的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先是村子遭了天災，唯一的女兒也死在那時候，我一把年紀又得了這病，這條老命應該是難留在這世上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的米佳......你怎麼這麼狠心，就這樣把媽媽一個人丟在世上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（抓住老婦人的手）奶奶您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，怎麼了，和你講這些話惹你煩了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有沒有，我想聽聽奶奶您的事情，和我再講講您的女兒吧，奶奶您這麼俊俏，您的女兒也一定是大美人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你還說自己嘴笨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我的米佳是村子裡公認的大美人，一頭金髮就像緞子一樣，又光又滑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的寶貝女兒啊。沒了她，我的心裡一直空落落的，活著也沒什麼意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "飯吃在嘴裡，什麼味道都沒有，這一天天只是數著日子百無聊賴地往後過罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，那你想吃酸味蘋果派嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎喲，你這一驚一乍的，嚇死我了......那是什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我們食堂新發明的菜式，酸酸甜甜的，吃著特別開胃。你要不要吃？我去給你拿些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。小丫頭，老婆子我什麼也不想吃......你陪我說說話就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那好，奶奶你接著講，我都聽著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......說起蘋果，米佳最愛吃了，她還不愛吃甜的，就愛吃酸的，呵呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，我就吃不了太酸，肯定會倒牙的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我的米佳牙口就可好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_iceforest_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，昨天下了一整夜的雪，早上起來室外空氣可新鮮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一大早就來找我，就不怕耽誤工作嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的，奶奶，我工作沒有排那麼滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想著你們醫生總是那麼忙，應該沒什麼時間來聽我這老婆子絮叨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘻嘻，奶奶你難道不喜歡看到我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這丫頭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話，我見到你啊，心裡確實還挺暢快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不瞞你，奶奶，我昨天回去後也想著你呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼呢，小丫頭......我這個糟老婆子有什麼好想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的年紀......和我外祖母差不多，樣子也差不多。看到你，我就會想起小時候在她身邊的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我要是能有個外孫女，應該也和你差不多大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一定很喜歡她，和她很親近吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，沒錯，我製藥的技藝都是她手把手教給我的，是她領著我在密林中一株一株地辨識藥草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也多虧她教我掌握了識路的方法，現在無論我去到哪裡，都不會迷路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......你想家了嗎，小丫頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，很想，特別地想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老婆子我也想啊，可是再也見不到了......上哪兒也找不到了，我的米佳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，您不要太過傷心，米佳小姐她......或許還會回到您身邊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小丫頭，你說的什麼傻話，人死了就沒了，怎麼可能再回來？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，您、您別生氣，我們部、部族裡的人都是這麼、這麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們、我們都相信，已逝之人會經由草木之靈的引領到達綠色秘境，重新成為大自然的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以每當有族人去世，我們便會聚在河邊，讓小船盛著蠟燭順流漂遠，希望可以照亮他們回來的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......小丫頭，就算、就算像你說的一樣，我的米佳真的能回來，她會......變成什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，我也不知道米佳小姐會變成什麼，如果在天上，大概就變成亮亮的星與輕輕的風，在湖裡，就可以化成小小的雪花和細細的雨絲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是在地上......會變成草吧，柔柔的，很可愛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可這天沒邊地沒限的，我要上哪裡去找她呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我們沒法兒找，只能等她來找我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以在部族的葬禮上，族長還會帶我們跳引靈舞，指引那些離開的人與我們重聚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小丫頭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那樣的舞，你會不會？能不能跳一支......給她，給我的米佳？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......媽媽想看看她，不論是什麼樣子，都想見見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "末藥大概不知道，她跳得真的很糟糕。\n她腳步遲緩，一點也跟不上手部的動作，或許在田地裡揚麥子的農婦，動作都比她更加優美協調。\n在柳芭女士的眼中，她更似一隻在雪地中奮力撲騰的小羽獸，動作滑稽又可笑。\n可柳芭女士沒有笑，就在末藥揮舞著雙臂在雪地裡兜圈的時候，一陣帶著寒氣的晨風吹亂了柳芭女士額前的髮絲。\n她閉上眼，感受氣流輕輕撫摸自己的面頰。突然，她覺得自己眼眶有些酸脹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小丫頭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摔倒）哎呀，轉的圈太多了，好暈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，您怎、怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們回去吧......我突然想吃酸味蘋果派了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一個月後"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿德萊啊，你來啦，哎呦，我離開之前還能再見你一面真是太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，你的病情控制得很好，以後注意飲食，按時服用抑制劑，短期內應該是不會再出現惡化的情況了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，好，阿德萊，你這個月不分日夜為我這把老骨頭操勞，真是辛苦你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼會，這些都是我分內的事。哦，對了，我從食堂給你打包了一份酸味蘋果派，你路上帶著吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿德萊啊，你真的是有心了。老婆子我愛吃什麼，你都記得清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，我送你走一段吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿德萊，老婆子我來這之前，是一點活下去的指望都沒有，每天枯坐在床上，滿腦子都是趕緊兩腿一蹬算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好遇到了你，幸好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在啊，覺得米佳好像就在我身邊，我看遠處的雪山，看跟前的松樹，花啊草啊雨啊雪啊，都覺得是她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這都是很好的東西，我是該多看看，得該多看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我啊，得好好活著，才能再多看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，你能這麼想，米佳小姐一定很高興。你一定要好好保重身體，以後再見的機會不多，我也希望你能好好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，小丫頭，看看你，眼圈都紅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "末藥笑了笑，抓緊老婦人的手，一路上兩人沒再說話，只是安靜地走在雪地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一直走到村門口，老婦人才猶豫著將內心的話說出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿德萊，老婆子問你一句話，你千萬不要拿假話回我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說的那些事情......到底是真的還是假的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話吧，我就是想聽聽你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從小到大，每當我生病的時候，族長都會熬制一支藥劑給我喝。每每服下這劑藥，我都能很快痊癒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直以為，它真的是一種了不得的藥劑，所以對它的神奇藥效深信不疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後來我來到艦上，學習到系統的醫學知識與理論，也學會了先進的製藥法，我便第一時間將這支藥劑的成分研究提上了日程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是結果讓我很失望......它只是一種普通的草本飲料，並沒有什麼特殊的效用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "於是我停下了後續的研究工作，把資料鎖進櫃子裡，轉而開始了另一種藥物的開發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是再生病受傷的時候，卻還是習慣性地給自己煮了一碗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果到最後，實驗不順利要喝一碗，半夜睡不著要喝一碗，走路摔跤了回到家也要喝一碗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒效果還要喝......小丫頭，你說，人怎麼就那麼傻呢，明知道是假的，卻還是願意相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奶奶，我也不知道為什麼......對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼呢......是啊，為什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_jungle_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈默妮，你說這些都是真的嗎？這支舞跳完，亡者就能回到我們身邊嗎？綠色秘境真的存在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈默妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿德萊......我回答不了你的問題，我不知道答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你為什麼還堅持在葬禮上跟著族長一起跳引靈舞，既然你自己都說不準。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈默妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我希望這一切是真的，我也希望終有一日可以與那些離開我們的人重聚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈默妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我願意為此而起舞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈默妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這世上苦難太多，問題太多，無助者求助無門只能自幫自助，無知者求知無路只能自問自答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈默妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以只能把精神寄託在虛妄的事物上來換些安心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈默妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我們只能......迷信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，哈默妮......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大概信了，假的也是真的了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罷了罷了，一大把歲數了，還計較這真真假假的做什麼，嫌活得長了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小丫頭，我這裡也沒什麼別的東西給你，這是我男人臨走時留給我的一串掛珠，你收下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，奶奶，這我不能收。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收著吧，不是什麼貴重玩意兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "末藥",
      "speakerId": "avg_117_myrrh_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝奶奶你的好意了，可是......醫療部有規定，不能隨意收受患者的禮物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_093",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這東西會給你帶來好運的，小丫頭，收下吧，我希望你能好好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "望著柳芭女士離去的背影，阿德萊揉揉眼睛，想起了小時候坐在哈默妮身旁，一起看向遠處的河床。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
